<title>UK: NWE gasoline rises with Brent rally, tight supply.</title>
<headline>NWE gasoline rises with Brent rally, tight supply.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE gasoline prices edged higher on Friday tracking gains in Brent crude and tight supply of high octane material, traders said.</p>
<p>A Eurograde barge traded at $228 fob ARA and Nov swaps traded late in the day at $225.50, up from $223.50 on Thursday, traders said. Dec swaps also rose about $1 to $209.</p>
<p>&quot;There is very little mogas around,&quot; said one trader, citing refinery maintenance programs.</p>
<p>-- John Hanley, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8185</p>
